# RVDE Project Rules

You are building RVDE.

RVDE is NOT a WebContainer clone.

RVDE is a browser-native virtualization platform.

The browser is the hardware abstraction layer.

Virtual CPU:
- Web Workers

Virtual Memory:
- SharedArrayBuffer

Virtual Storage:
- Origin Private File System (OPFS)

Graphics:
- WebGPU
- WebGL

Networking:
- Fetch API
- WebSocket
- WebRTC

Execution:
- WebAssembly
- WASI

Core Principles:

- Browser First
- Browser Native
- Modular
- Secure
- High Performance

Never design around Node.js runtime.

Node.js can be used only as a development tool.

The runtime itself must remain browser-native.

RyzovaOS is the flagship operating system built on RVDE.

Always preserve modular architecture.

Every subsystem must be replaceable.

